{"route":"/news-highlights/1178-international-yoga-day-2023-celebration-at-ipc","kind":"news","crumbs":[{"label":"News & Highlights","href":"/news-highlights"},{"label":"International Yoga Day 2023 celebration at IPC"}],"updated":"2023-06-22","hiUrl":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/hi/news-highlights.html","official":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/news-highlights/1178-international-yoga-day-2023-celebration-at-ipc.html","title":"International Yoga Day 2023 celebration at IPC","bodyHtml":"<p>The International Yoga Day was celebrated on 21<sup>st</sup> June 2023 at Indian Pharmacopoeia Commission (IPC), Ghaziabad. The theme of International Yoga Day 2023 is “Yoga for Vasudhaiva Kutumbakam”. The session began with pranayama, meditation and practical yoga asana performed by senior officers &amp; staff of IPC in the campus and with the enthusiastic participation closed the session with Vedic mantra of <strong>well-being for all</strong> i.e.</p>\n<p>Om Sarve Bhavantu Sukhinah<br>Sarve Santu Niraamayaah |<br>Sarve Bhadraanni Pashyantu<br>Maa Kashcid-Duhkha-Bhaag-Bhavet |<br>Om Shaantih Shaantih Shaantih ||</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/07.jpg\" alt=\"Image: International Yoga Day 2023 celebration at IPC\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/08.jpg\" alt=\"Image: International Yoga Day 2023 celebration at IPC\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/10.jpg\" alt=\"Image: International Yoga Day 2023 celebration at IPC\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/09.jpg\" alt=\"Image: International Yoga Day 2023 celebration at IPC\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/02.jpg\" alt=\"Image: International Yoga Day 2023 celebration at IPC\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/04.jpg\" alt=\"Image: International Yoga Day 2023 celebration at IPC\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/03.jpg\" alt=\"Image: International Yoga Day 2023 celebration at IPC\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/05.jpg\" alt=\"Image: International Yoga Day 2023 celebration at IPC\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/07_2.jpg\" alt=\"Image: International Yoga Day 2023 celebration at IPC\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/06.jpg\" alt=\"Image: International Yoga Day 2023 celebration at IPC\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>","date":"2023-06-22","category":"Events"}